\ Plain English presentation for a successfully completed date.
\ This is NOT a change to the canonical five numeric components:
\ their indices remain authoritative for equality and testing.
\ The English labels come from the frozen source-language catalogue.
\ Never render an unsuccessful or incomplete date as an old result.

The complete English date text is a string.

To render the complete date in English:
  Put "" into the complete English date text.
  If the complete date status is not 1, exit.
  Read the English cutlet name given the complete date answer's cutlet name index.
  Read the English month name given the complete date answer's month name index.
  If the English cutlet name is blank, exit.
  If the English month name is blank, exit.
  Convert the complete date answer's year number to a string.
  Put the string into the complete English date text.
  Append ", " to the complete English date text.
  Append the English cutlet name to the complete English date text.
  Append ", " to the complete English date text.
  Convert the complete date answer's day within cutlet to a string.
  Append the string to the complete English date text.
  Append ", " to the complete English date text.
  Append the English month name to the complete English date text.
  Append ", " to the complete English date text.
  Convert the complete date answer's day within month to a string.
  Append the string to the complete English date text.
